+# G3 status — unified retrieval routing
+
+## Built in this implementation branch
+
+- Added `agent/retrieval_router.py`, a pure deterministic Goal 3 planner/router helper module.
+- Added route descriptors for:
+  - `memory_semantic`
+  - `session_semantic`
+  - `session_fts`
+  - `web_search`
